/* ── COMPARISON ──
 * Nested list format: 2 li, each with **Title** + sublist body.
 * Optional trailing p for below-note.
 */
section.compare-prose { }
/* The stage is a flex column so the comparison list (`> :is(ul,ol) { flex:1 }`) fills
 * the bounded stage (flex cell-tree §6); the section carried no display, so the codemod
 * left the cell without one. The two cards then stretch to the stage height with the
