/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * BAND CYCLE — sections / clusters / category panels
 * ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * The `.section-N` class is emitted by timeline, kanban, mindmap, and
 * (indirectly via journey-style cycles) every diagram that uses Mermaid's
 * categorical cluster scheme. Mermaid's own auto-emitted CSS uses the
 * same selector but indexes from 0..N for sections counted from 1; the
 * timeline renderer additionally offsets `f = r % h - 1`, so the first
 * timeline period gets `section--1` (literal double-dash) which Mermaid
 * NEVER styles. We cover `section--1` plus `section-0..section-11` here
 * so every diagram type lands on a tested-contrast band.
 */
