/* Root node: Mermaid emits classes "section-root" AND "section--1"
 * (note double-dash = minus one). Both have hardcoded fills:
 *   .section-root → #C20000 (red — alarm color, wrong for root)
 *   .section--1   → #5C9DD3 (cScale1 mid-blue)
